# Top-level repo metadata — in repo for humans/CI, not for $HOME.
README.md
AGENTS.md
LICENSE

# opencode runtime artifacts — checked into source so `chezmoi update` pulls
# them, but ignored from deployment. (Under Stow, these were gitignored AND
# leaked through the directory symlink; under chezmoi the live ~/.config/opencode/
# is a real dir, so opencode's own writes stay in $HOME, hygienic.)
.config/opencode/node_modules
.config/opencode/package.json
.config/opencode/package-lock.json
.config/opencode/.gitignore
.config/opencode/*.bak
.config/opencode/plugins/